<title>USA: Science Dynamics to remain on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Science Dynamics to remain on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Science Dynamics Corp said Wednesday it has been informed that Nasdaq has found the company in compliance with requirements for continued listing on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>The company said the qualification was aided by two factors: the acquisition of Innovative Communications Technology and the large orders received for the company's 3-Way Call Detection System and Automated Operator System.</p>
</text>
